    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cold walls. An empty room. A missing sister\u2026 Chloe has no choice but to unravel this mystery\u2014no matter how difficult it may be to move forward.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chloe, a young girl with a disability, and her older sister Kamila have faced many hardships. Despite everything, Kamila has always done her best to help Chloe reclaim a sense of normalcy. But now, Kamila is gone, and Chloe is trapped in a crumbling house filled with eerie silence and unanswered questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a haunting visual novel where the bond between two sisters is tested by an unknown force. As Chloe searches for a way out, she must navigate eerie rooms, uncover hidden objects, and piece together the secrets buried deep within these walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every discovery, memories resurface, unveiling the complex relationship between the sisters and the hidden truths of their family's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you escape? And more importantly\u2014can you uncover what truly happened to Kamila?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Multiple locations</strong> \u2013 Each scene pulls you deeper into the game's immersive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Item search</strong> \u2013 Explore your surroundings, find hidden objects, and use them to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Gradual story unveiling</strong> \u2013 No clear answers at the start\u2014the mystery unfolds step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Atmospheric soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Tense, haunting melodies heighten the suspense and intrigue.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cold walls. An empty room. A missing sister\u2026 Chloe has no choice but to unravel this mystery\u2014no matter how difficult it may be to move forward.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chloe, a young girl with a disability, and her older sister Kamila have faced many hardships. Despite everything, Kamila has always done her best to help Chloe reclaim a sense of normalcy. But now, Kamila is gone, and Chloe is trapped in a crumbling house filled with eerie silence and unanswered questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a haunting visual novel where the bond between two sisters is tested by an unknown force. As Chloe searches for a way out, she must navigate eerie rooms, uncover hidden objects, and piece together the secrets buried deep within these walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every discovery, memories resurface, unveiling the complex relationship between the sisters and the hidden truths of their family's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you escape? And more importantly\u2014can you uncover what truly happened to Kamila?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Multiple locations</strong> \u2013 Each scene pulls you deeper into the game's immersive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Item search</strong> \u2013 Explore your surroundings, find hidden objects, and use them to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Gradual story unveiling</strong> \u2013 No clear answers at the start\u2014the mystery unfolds step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Atmospheric soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Tense, haunting melodies heighten the suspense and intrigue.</p>",
